[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; The "pop" a swarmling bursts into. Same self-freeing one-shot pattern as hit_spark.tscn, but
; violet, puffier and slower-falling so a cleave through several of them reads as a spray of motes
; rather than a shower of sparks.

